<title>PHILIPPINES: PCIBank 9-mth net 2.173 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>PCIBank 9-mth net 2.173 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in billion pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			 2.173 vs 1.775</p>
<p>    Interest income		  7.899 vs 6.046</p>
<p>    Other income		     2.049 vs 2.040</p>
<p>Note: Full name Philippine Commercial International Bank.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
